{\pard\sa110\sb260 \cf1\fs28\b 1. Opportunity and mission\par}
{\pard\sa100\sb0 \fs20 Estates, campuses and industrial parks own 11 kV boards, cables and transformers but rarely have in-house HV engineers. Maintenance is often reactive, test records sit on paper, and outages are badly planned. GridGuard HV Services sells a complete, documented maintenance service built on one proven method: plan, baseline, test, certify, monitor, improve.\par}
{\pard\sa100\sb0 \fs20\b Mission: keep HV estates safe and available, with every test traceable and every outage planned.\par}
