{\pard\sa100\sb0 \cf4\fs18 Reference site: 10 transformers, 10 cable circuits and 1 11 kV board, the same as the project estate. Prices rise 3% a year from year 2. Setup is billed once on each new site.\par}
{\pard\sa110\sb260 \cf1\fs28\b 3. Customers\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Residential and mixed-use estates with private HV networks\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Commercial parks, malls and hospitals that need high availability\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Campuses and industrial parks with several substations\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Developers handing over new estates who need an operating contractor\par}
{\pard\sa100\sb0 \fs20 Entry offer: a fixed-price baseline survey (thermography and PD) that produces a health index and a costed maintenance plan.\par}
{\pard\sa110\sb260 \cf1\fs28\b 4. Operating model\par}
{\pard\sa100\sb0 \fs20 The enterprise runs the same workflows as the project, with the seven improvement targets built in:\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Test records and certificates entered once on mobile and compiled automatically\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Thermography and PD analysis with AI hot-spot detection and a rule-based A to D health grade\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Load-aware shutdown planning and bulk work-order creation\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Fault location and RCA supported by relay waveform data and GIS\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Permit and switching programme templates checked against the single-line diagram\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Asset register and data standard so AI can learn from clean records\par}
{\pard\sa60\sb0\li360\fi-360 \fs20 \u8226?	Automatic KPI and audit reporting\par}
{\pard\sa100\sb0 \fs20\b Human gates never change: isolation, switching, return to service and safety sign-off stay with a competent Authorised Person. AI is advisory only.\par}
